    "content": "📌 PHYSICS\n• Motion in a Plane-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Laws of Motion-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Work, Energy and Power-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Centre of Mass & System of Particles-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Rotational Motion-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Gravitation-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Current Electricity (Full Chapter)\n• Capacitors (Full Chapter)\n• Moving Charges and Magnetism (Full Chapter)\n• Magnetism and Matter (Full Chapter)\n\n📌 CHEMISTRY\n• Classification of Elements and Periodicity in Properties-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Chemical Bonding and Molecular Structure-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• State of matter-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Thermodynamics -Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Redox Reaction-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Equilibrium-Class 11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Haloalkanes and Haloarenes (Optical Isomerism & Hydrocarbon) (Complete Chapter)\n\n📌 MATHEMATICS\n• Complex Number -I Class-11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Sequence and Series- Class-11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Relation Function- Class-11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Permutations and Combinations-Class-11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Binomial theorem-Class-11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Straight Lines-Class-11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Circles-Class-11th (Complete Chapter)\n• Relations and Functions (Complete Chapter)\n• Inverse Trigonometric Functions (Complete Chapter)"
